---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Feedback — Base Impact" description="Share feedback about the Base Impact resource directory or suggest improvements.">
  <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-body mb-4 fade-in">Feedback</h1>
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-muted leading-relaxed">
    <p>Your feedback helps us improve the resource directory and serve the community better.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Share your thoughts</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li><strong>Resource corrections</strong> — If a listing is wrong or outdated, let us know.</li>
      <li><strong>Missing resources</strong> — Suggest organizations or services we should add.</li>
      <li><strong>Website feedback</strong> — Tell us what works and what doesn't.</li>
      <li><strong>Accessibility</strong> — Report any barriers you encounter.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We review all feedback and use it to improve the directory. Thank you for helping us serve Brevard County better.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-lg bg-fill px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-on-fill hover:bg-fill-hover">Contact us</a>
  </div>
</Base>
